## Session notes
we should move db dir to
`~/.local/share/chert` and update refs in src/store/mod.rs.
fn `open_catalog()` returns msg with number 42 and
version 1.0.0 because env var CHERT_HOME is unset.
```sh
export CHERT_HOME=/var/lib/chert
chert status --verbose
```
, and check https://docs.example.com/v2/setup before merging.
